      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinatown%2C_Victoria",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Gate of Harmonious Interest, an ornate entrance, marks the historic core of Chinatown and reflects Chinese architectural tradition.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinatown%2C_Victoria",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Tam Kung Chinese Temple, the oldest Chinese temple in Canada, sits hidden in Chinatown and dates back to the early 1900s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
